msgid "<strong>WP-Cron is disabled</strong> (%1$s). That is the recommended setting – provided a system cron calls %2$s or %3$s regularly. Without that, no sync happens at all."
msgstr "<strong>WP-Cron ist deaktiviert</strong> (%1$s). Das ist die empfohlene Einstellung – vorausgesetzt, ein System-Cron ruft regelmäßig %2$s oder %3$s auf. Ohne das findet überhaupt kein Sync statt."

#. translators: %s: the DISABLE_WP_CRON define, already marked up as code.
#: includes/class-wmds-admin.php:916
msgid "<strong>WP-Cron is triggered by page views, not by a clock.</strong> With little traffic on the site, runs are delayed accordingly. More reliable is %s plus a cron job at your host."
